OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fstart to the evening with some
OL,7,Foccasional light rain at first in the
OL,8,Fsouth. Clear skies will develop across
OL,9,Fthe region through the night, allowing
OL,10,Ftemperatures to readily fall.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA cool start to the morning
OL,13,Funder clear skies. Becoming cloudier
OL,14,Fwith the chance of some showers
OL,15,Fdeveloping during the afternoon,
OL,16,Fmainly over high ground and along the
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
