OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCooler
OL,6,Fthrough this period, with sunny spells
OL,7,Fand showers. Showers most frequent
OL,8,Fnear the coast, though occasionally
OL,9,Fspreading inland. Winds mostly light,
OL,10,Fbut breezy at times near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
